  = must: plan future implementation without writing implementation code, fixture source files, expected ledger files, generated output files, dependency changes, package metadata changes, adapters, transports, UI, dispatch mechanisms, process control, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job control, credential access, network mutation, destructive filesystem actions, operations control, or live machine control
